<header><div class="container nav"><a class="logo" href="index.php"><span>IRO</span> Issues Reporting Outlet</a><nav><a href="#about">About</a><a href="#report">Report Issue</a><a href="#track">Track Report</a></nav></div></header>
<main><section class="hero"><div class="container hero-grid"><div><span class="eyebrow">A voice for every community</span><h1>Raise an issue.<br><em>Make your voice count.</em></h1><p>A simple reporting outlet for AAUA students and residents of Akungba, Iwaro, Etioro, Ayegunle and nearby communities.</p><div class="actions"><a class="btn" href="#report">Submit a report →</a><a class="btn secondary" href="#track">Track a report</a></div></div><div class="hero-card"><div class="bubble">✓</div><h2>Your concerns matter.</h2><p>Share a community issue, get a unique reference, and check its review status.</p><div class="steps"><span>01 Submit</span><span>02 Receive ID</span><span>03 Track</span></div></div></div></section>
